		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Hello,</p><p>You cannot change this parameter without recompiling postgres.&#160; I&#039;d not recommand to do it though.&#160; If you need more than 100 parameters in your function, you should probably try to think of a better design to achieve your need.&#160; As a blind guess, I&#039;d say to get all the needed information from your table(s), and reduce parameters to the PK(s) and some few additional parameters.</p>]]></content>
